jeremyText="This upgraded version is completely invulnerable."
chaoText="I'm sure they made their invulnerability elixir out of dead spinies. Bastards."
devText="Can't have you killing the only threatening enemy. 'But spinach, why does he have a bullet bill blaster hidden in his cloud?', you ask? Well, to fully understand the transformation that has occured in the Lakitu population, we need to go back to the year 1994 and understand the causes for the Goomba rebellion that took place at that time. As I'm sure you're aware, the ones who incited this uprising were none other than the Lakitu elite. You should also know that at that they the Lakitus were desperately trying to improve their social standing as they could simply not stand being seen as 'regular enemies'. While that by itself was not enough to force their hand, combined with the fact that many Goombas felt ill-treated and the Parakoopas weakening position they decided to take fate into their own hands. It was during these turbulous times that a Lakitu we now know as 'Ihopethisisalreadyoffscreen' befriended a BB-smith..."
